{"mode":"words","text":"Tagad tu klausies tekstu un vienlaikus lasi līdzi. Ja esi iesācējs, lasi nozīmes rindu savā dzimtajā valodā, klausies mērķvalodā lēnā tempā un bieži nospied pauzes pogu — tādējādi tavs prāts saista skaņu ar nozīmi. Ja esi vidēja līmeņa valodas lietotājs, lasi oriģinālo tekstu un tikai pie nezināmiem vārdiem īsi paskaties uz leju. Šajā procesā bieži izmanto A-B atkārtojumu: atzīmē vienu teikumu un atkārto to ciklā — izmēģini to augšā.","words":[{"s":0,"e":240},{"s":267,"e":320},{"s":380,"e":800},{"s":860,"e":1280},{"s":1387,"e":1600},{"s":1627,"e":2080},{"s":2140,"e":2400},{"s":2440,"e":2960},{"s":3200,"e":3680},{"s":3740,"e":3920},{"s":4000,"e":4960},{"s":5040,"e":5360},{"s":5413,"e":5920},{"s":5960,"e":6320},{"s":6360,"e":6560},{"s":6587,"e":7040},{"s":7080,"e":7920},{"s":7960,"e":8480},{"s":8520,"e":9200},{"s":9280,"e":9600},{"s":9680,"e":10240},{"s":10427,"e":10800},{"s":10840,"e":11200},{"s":11280,"e":11600},{"s":11680,"e":12160},{"s":12240,"e":12560},{"s":12840,"e":13120},{"s":13160,"e":13680},{"s":13728,"e":13920},{"s":13973,"e":14320},{"s":14373,"e":14720},{"s":14780,"e":15200},{"s":15227,"e":15280},{"s":15360,"e":15920},{"s":16240,"e":16880},{"s":16940,"e":17120},{"s":17180,"e":17520},{"s":17560,"e":17920},{"s":17960,"e":18320},{"s":18347,"e":19120},{"s":19300,"e":19920},{"s":19980,"e":20560},{"s":20640,"e":21040},{"s":21227,"e":21600},{"s":21640,"e":21920},{"s":21960,"e":22080},{"s":22133,"e":22720},{"s":22800,"e":23200},{"s":23600,"e":23760},{"s":23800,"e":24240},{"s":24293,"e":24400},{"s":24453,"e":24800},{"s":25240,"e":25840},{"s":25909,"e":26400},{"s":26480,"e":26800},{"s":26853,"e":27360},{"s":27480,"e":27920},{"s":28000,"e":28880},{"s":29147,"e":30000},{"s":30053,"e":30400},{"s":30453,"e":30880},{"s":31067,"e":31440},{"s":31493,"e":32000},{"s":32053,"e":32160},{"s":32200,"e":32560},{"s":32880,"e":33200},{"s":33253,"e":33760},{"s":33813,"e":33920},{"s":33980,"e":34560}]}